{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11205090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11205090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120509001:1":{"text":"어머, 꼬마야. 네 뒤에 따라오는 저 튼실한 녀석이 마을을 소란스럽게 만든 주범이겠지?","source_cn":"呀，小丫头，你身后跟着的这大家伙，够壮实！镇上的骚动肯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x731182DA9EB89E85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120509002:1":{"text":"얼마에 샀어? 가격 꽤 줬겠지? 그 <style=\"highlight\">경매</style>에 온 사람들 대부분이 바람잡이라던데…","source_cn":"你花了多少钱才拿下它？估计不便宜吧，听说那<style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCE792D926871A83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120509003:1":{"text":"경… 매…요?","source_cn":"拍……买……会？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF2262670D611622","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120509004:1":{"text":"몰라? 그럼 됐어. 못 들은 걸로 해.","source_cn":"不知道？那就别在意，当我没说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F9050B4E9E6B76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120509005:1":{"text":"가죽 사러 온 거지! 이게 다 요 며칠 내에 새로 들여온 거라 품질은 최고야!","source_cn":"还是来看看我家的兽皮吧！都是我这两天新收的，质量绝对没的说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB75F5D7B4E2072DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120509006:1":{"text":"털 있는 걸로 주세요! 안탄드라 누나가… 음, 텐트만큼 커야 한다고 했어요. 50장이요!","source_cn":"要，长毛的！安丹姐说……嗯，要帐篷那么大，五十张！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB26E7E0AA9E6E0D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120509007:1":{"text":"양이 적지 않은데… 일단 가게에 재고가 있는지 한 번 찾아볼게.","source_cn":"这量可不小啊，等我算算店里这些够不够。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19B590FD427BB628","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120509008:1":{"text":"어머, 이런 우연이! 마침 딱 50장이 있네.","source_cn":"哟，正正好！卖完你这五十张，我这儿就只剩几张边角料了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80DF6619C0C8898E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120509009:1":{"text":"꼬마야, 이 언니가 가격을 계산해 줄게… 음, 대량 구매니까 10% 할인에 우수리는 떼고… 200골드야! 어때? 현금 아니면 저당?","source_cn":"让我算一下总价……嗯，你要了这么多，打个九折再抹零……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8159F405DE38A99A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1120509009":{"text":"꼬마야, 이 언니가 가격을 계산해 줄게… 음, 대량 구매니까 10% 할인에 우수리는 떼고… 200골드야! 어때? 현금 아니면 저당?","source_cn":"让我算一下总价……嗯，你要了这么多，打个九折再抹零……就这个数吧，两百枚金币！现金还是拿东西抵押？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8159F405DE38A99A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120509010:2":{"text":"그러니까요. 가죽 한 장에 4골드나 받다니…!","source_cn":"就是啊，一张毛皮居然要四枚金币……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x231BF59EE6AD33AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120509013:1":{"text":"뭘 모르네. 이 정도로 튼튼한 가죽은 4골드에 팔아도 제값을 받지 못하는 거라고.","source_cn":"唉，一看你们就不识货。这么结实的兽皮，卖四金币都算便宜的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x554FDDA51FEB3CB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120509014:1":{"text":"게다가 당신들이 돈을 내는 것도 아니고, 꼬마가 지금 고민 중이잖아요. 이 가격이면 손해 보는 장사 아니라고요!","source_cn":"再说了，又不是你们付钱，小丫头还在算呢。这价格，你们不吃亏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEB4F9A2A8B0B035","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120509015:1":{"text":"음, 안탄드라 누나가 두 가지를 사오라고 400골드를 줬으니… 400의 절반은 200이고…","source_cn":"唔，安丹姐给了四百，要买两样东西……四百的一半是两百……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC7EF603C89ED5A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120509016:1":{"text":"200이면 절반… 앗! 사도 돼요!","source_cn":"两百，刚好一半！可以买！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB60B583C935EF181","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1120509016":{"text":"200이면 절반… 앗! 사도 돼요!","source_cn":"两百，刚好一半！可以买！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB60B583C935EF181","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120509018:1":{"text":"예… 산...?","source_cn":"雨……算？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6B2031A659E7DE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120509020:1":{"text":"걱정 마요. 흥정은 저랑 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님한테 맡기세요!","source_cn":"不用担心，砍价的事就包在我和<style=stress...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBED11D9D46735ABF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"걱정 마요. 흥정은 저랑 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님한테 맡기세요!","female":"걱정 마요. 흥정은 저랑 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님한테 맡기세요!","variant_male_record_index":"125133","variant_female_record_index":"125134","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"잠깐만, 좀 더 깎을 수 있을 거야","source_cn":"先别答应，价格还能更低","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEB4CC68CC39D1DE3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"잠깐만, 좀 더 깎을 수 있을 거야","female":"잠깐만, 좀 더 깎을 수 있을 거야","variant_male_record_index":"64228","variant_female_record_index":"64229","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120509019:1":{"text":"카이는 잘 모르겠어요!","source_cn":"卡卡不明白！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA951F544B4B